<title>POLAND: Izolacja 1996 net rises to PLN 11.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Izolacja 1996 net rises to PLN 11.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Izolacja SA results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			19.27 vs   13.34</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  17.57 vs   13.01</p>
<p>    net profit				11.39 vs    8.37</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Izolacja SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				127.21 vs   93.09</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  89.88 vs   67.61</p>
<p>    extraordinary			    0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    income tax				 6.18 vs   46.38</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs    0.00</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     1.18 vs    1.02</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.88 vs    1.35</p>
<p>    investment				12.20 vs    4.20</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
